# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GET /tasks — scoping check
#   Admin  → sees ALL tasks (200 with both tasks)
#   User   → sees ONLY their own tasks (200 with only the user123 task)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN] List all tasks — expect: both tasks visible
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### [USER123] List tasks — expect: only user123's task visible
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GET /tasks/:id — ownership check
#   Owner of the task → 200
#   Non-owner regular user → 403
#   Admin (non-owner) → 200  (admin override)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN] Get admin's own task — expect: 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{admin_task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### [ADMIN] Get user123's task — expect: 200 (admin can see any task)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{user_task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### [USER123] Get own task — expect: 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{user_task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### [USER123] Get admin's task — expect: 403 (not owner, not admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{admin_task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PUT /tasks/:id — ownership check
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [USER123] Update own task — expect: 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{user_task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "title":  "User123 Task (updated)",
  "status": "in_progress"
}

###

### [USER123] Update admin's task — expect: 403 (not owner, not admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{admin_task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "title": "Hacked admin task"
}

###

### [ADMIN] Update any task — expect: 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{user_task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "status": "done"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GET /users/:user_id/tasks — ownership check
#   Route protected with withOwnership=true, same rules apply.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Decode user123's user_id from the JWT at https://jwt.io
### and paste below
@user123_id = 019e2a89-ce19-7082-a266-4cbd8af1c863
@admin_id   = bd006d41-aded-4040-9934-2ba4e909ef9a

### [USER123] Get own user tasks — expect: 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{user123_id}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### [USER123] Get admin's tasks via user route — expect: 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{admin_id}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### [ADMIN] Get user123's tasks via user route — expect: 200 (admin override)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{user123_id}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DELETE /tasks/:id — no ownership check, requires task:delete permission
#   Only admin role has task:delete
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [USER123] Delete a task — expect: 403 (no task:delete permission)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{user_task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### [ADMIN] Delete admin task — expect: 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{admin_task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###
